<title>USA: Flexsteel completes Dygert acquisition.</title>
<headline>Flexsteel completes Dygert acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>DUBUQUE, Iowa 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flexsteel Industries Inc, a seating manufacturer, said Tuesday it completed its acquisition of the assets of  Dygert Seating following court approval.</p>
<p>Flexsteel said the transaction broadens its line of van and light truck seating.</p>
<p>The company said Dygert's vehicle seating sales exceeded $30 million in 1996. With the new lines, Flexsteel said it expects to realize about a 50 percent increase in typical annual sales of about $60 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
